BT /F2 10.5 Tf 0.100 0.200 0.450 rg 50.00 681.50 Td (1. Purpose and Architectural Design Choices) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.150 0.150 0.200 rg 45.00 660.00 Td (The goal of this assignment is to develop an in-memory hierarchical file system and implement the Visitor pattern to support) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 0.150 0.150 0.200 rg 45.00 649.00 Td (three independent, extensible operations \(TotalSizeVisitor, SearchVisitor, StatisticsVisitor\) over the same composite tree.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.5 Tf 0.100 0.200 0.450 rg 45.00 634.00 Td (1. Object Model & Double Dispatch:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.200 0.200 0.250 rg 45.00 623.00 Td (   * Element declares accept\(Visitor\) along with hierarchical getters/setters \(getName\(\), getParent\(\), setParent\(\)\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.200 0.200 0.250 rg 45.00 613.00 Td (   * FileNode represents files with non-negative byte sizes. DirectoryNode stores named children in arbitrary nesting.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.200 0.200 0.250 rg 45.00 603.00 Td (   * Double dispatch: \(1\) client invokes element.accept\(visitor\); \(2\) concrete node delegates visitor.visit\(this\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.200 0.200 0.250 rg 45.00 593.00 Td (     The compiler binds 'this' statically, routing execution to the correct visit overload without any instanceof branching.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.5 Tf 0.100 0.200 0.450 rg 45.00 579.00 Td (2. Traversal Ownership Decision \(Visitor-Managed\):) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.200 0.200 0.250 rg 45.00 568.00 Td (   * Traversal is owned by Visitors inside visit\(DirectoryNode\), which iterate children and call child.accept\(this\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.200 0.200 0.250 rg 45.00 558.00 Td (   * Rationale: Allows each visitor to customize its traversal state \(e.g., path stack in SearchVisitor, depth counter in) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.200 0.200 0.250 rg 45.00 548.00 Td (     StatisticsVisitor\) while preserving minimal accept\(v\) implementations in Element classes.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.5 Tf 0.100 0.200 0.450 rg 45.00 534.00 Td (3. Controlled State & Tree Invariants:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.200 0.200 0.250 rg 45.00 523.00 Td (   * Idempotent reusability: activeDepth counter resets state automatically on root entry; explicit reset\(\) is also available.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.200 0.200 0.250 rg 45.00 513.00 Td (   * Tree integrity: DirectoryNode.add\(\) prevents negative file sizes, duplicate sibling names \(IllegalArgumentException\),) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.200 0.200 0.250 rg 45.00 503.00 Td (     and rejects multiple parent ownership and circular references \(IllegalStateException\) through parent-chain traversal.) Tj ET
