BT /F2 8.8 Tf 0.150 0.250 0.450 rg 48.00 286.00 Td (Key Architectural Highlights & Invariant Defenses:) Tj ET
BT /F2 7.8 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.350 rg 52.00 270.00 Td (* Negative Byte Size Defense:) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.6 Tf 0.250 0.250 0.300 rg 195.00 270.00 Td (FileNode constructor validates 'size >= 0' and non-blank names, throwing IllegalArgumentException.) Tj ET
BT /F2 7.8 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.350 rg 52.00 257.50 Td (* Duplicate Sibling Prevention:) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.6 Tf 0.250 0.250 0.300 rg 195.00 257.50 Td (DirectoryNode.add checks existing child names before attachment, throwing IllegalArgumentException.) Tj ET
BT /F2 7.8 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.350 rg 52.00 245.00 Td (* Single Parent Ownership:) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.6 Tf 0.250 0.250 0.300 rg 195.00 245.00 Td (DirectoryNode.add verifies 'child.getParent\(\) == null || child.getParent\(\) == this' \(IllegalStateException\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 7.8 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.350 rg 52.00 232.50 Td (* Cycle Detection via Ancestor Chain:) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.6 Tf 0.250 0.250 0.300 rg 195.00 232.50 Td (DirectoryNode.add climbs the parent hierarchy to ensure child is not an ancestor \(IllegalStateException\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 7.8 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.350 rg 52.00 220.00 Td (* Encapsulated Directory Collections:) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.6 Tf 0.250 0.250 0.300 rg 195.00 220.00 Td (DirectoryNode.getChildren\(\) returns Collections.unmodifiableList\(\), preventing external modification.) Tj ET
BT /F2 7.8 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.350 rg 52.00 207.50 Td (* Root-Relative Deterministic Search:) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.6 Tf 0.250 0.250 0.300 rg 195.00 207.50 Td (SearchVisitor tracks path stacks using ArrayDeque; results use '/' separator and are lexicographically sorted.) Tj ET
BT /F2 7.8 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.350 rg 52.00 195.00 Td (* Depth & Metric Tracking:) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.6 Tf 0.250 0.250 0.300 rg 195.00 195.00 Td (StatisticsVisitor records fileCount, directoryCount \(including visited root\), and maxDepth \(root depth = 0\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 7.8 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.350 rg 52.00 182.50 Td (* Zero Runtime Type Discrimination:) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.6 Tf 0.250 0.250 0.300 rg 195.00 182.50 Td (No instanceof, getClass\(\), reflection, or downcasting is used anywhere in the codebase.) Tj ET
